{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true},"description":"Aggregate debit transactions by category, merchant, month, weekday, account, or statement over an explicit period of at most 366 days. Totals use { amount, currency } with amount as an exact decimal string; Currencies remain separate; bank-converted ones count in the account's. Category groups use the institution's label unless you set an override. Pending debits count by default and drop once posted. Internal transfers (incl. own-CPF Pix) are left out and reported under excluded unless includeInternalTransfers; generic TRANSFER is spending unless exclude has 'transfer'. exclude matches Mofi's classification (your override, else the provider category rule, else known operation codes). meta.warnings flags connections that hold the same bank data. Group keys: category 'override:<code>' (your override; drill down with mofi_transactions_get where.normalizedCode), 'value:<provider label>' (where.category) or 'unknown'; merchant 'value:<merchant>', 'description:<normalized description>' when the bank sent no merchant (where.search with a distinctive part), or 'unknown'. Pass page.nextCursor unchanged. For averages and top categories, prefer mofi_spending_summary_get.","inputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"exclude":{"default":[],"items":{"enum":["transfer","investment","card_payment"],"type":"string"},"maxItems":3,"type":"array"},"groupBy":{"enum":["category","merchant","month","weekday","account","statement"],"type":"string"},"includeInternalTransfers":{"default":false,"type":"boolean"},"includePending":{"default":true,"type":"boolean"},"mode":{"const":"query","type":"string"},"page":{"default":{"cursor":null,"limit":25},"properties":{"cursor":{"anyOf":[{"maxLength":2048,"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null},"limit":{"default":25,"maximum":100,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"}},"type":"object"},"where":{"oneOf":[{"description